  complianceRecordId          String?
  complianceRecord            EmployeeComplianceRecord?   @relation("TrainingParticipantComplianceLink", fields: [complianceRecordId], references: [id])
  /// Back-reference for the compliance record auto-generated by THIS completion.
  /// Distinct from `complianceRecord`, which may point at a record HR created by
